{
  "category": "resources",
  "title": "5 Questions for Emotional Clarity",
  "slug": "five-questions-for-emotional-clarity",
  "publishedAt": "2026-05-17T10:00:00.000Z",
  "draft": false,
  "excerpt": "Five gentle questions to sit with when things feel emotionally unclear — clarity often comes through noticing, not forcing.",
  "body": {
    "type": "root",
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "When things feel emotionally unclear, try gently sitting with these questions:"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "ul",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "li",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "lic",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "What am I feeling right now, without trying to fix it?"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "li",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "lic",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "What part of this situation feels heavy or unclear?"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "li",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "lic",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "What do I need more of in this moment — space, clarity, or support?"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "li",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "lic",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "What am I trying to control that is not fully mine to control?"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "li",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "lic",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "If I slowed down, what would become more visible?"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "There is no need to rush answers. Clarity often comes through noticing, not forcing."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
